# Claude Code. Project config is shared: the hooks and permissions in
# settings.json, the project instructions, and the verify skill (which documents
# this repo's own GUI test harness). Machine-local state stays out -
# settings.local.json is a per-machine permission allowlist - as do skills
# installed from elsewhere, which belong to their upstream, not to us.
# Git will not descend into an excluded directory, so each parent level has to
# be re-included for a negation to reach the files below it.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/verify/

# Project-specific
build/
# Intermediate PDFs from scripts/generate_how_to_pdfs.py and generate_intro_pdf.py
# (fed into GIMP).
docs/how-to-pdfs/
docs/intro-pdf/
# Standalone executables produced by scripts/build.sh (Nuitka output:
# onefile binaries on Linux/Windows, zipped .app bundles on macOS).
